(9997147, 'Altruism, of course! I had just inherited my mother\'s fortune and had no clue what to do with all that money. I spent my days indulging in vice, burning through bills in the betting houses of Undermine, when it hit me: the real problem in Azeroth wasn\'t hunger or violence; it was boredom!$B$BOnly a bored person has time to be sad. And who else would embark on the wasteful endeavor of starting a war?$B$BSo, I thought, why not heal Azeroth with laughter and bright colors? I\'d create a place where humans and orcs could understand each other, no matter their language, where everyone would have so much fun that there\'d be no time to harbor old hatreds.$B$BAltruism, my friend. And hey, if I make some money along the way, who could blame me?', 'Altruism, of course! I had just inherited my mother\'s fortune and had no clue what to do with all that money. I spent my days indulging in vice, burning through bills in the betting houses of Undermine, when it hit me: the real problem in Azeroth wasn\'t hunger or violence; it was boredom!$B$BOnly a bored person has time to be sad. And who else would embark on the wasteful endeavor of starting a war?$B$BSo, I thought, why not heal Azeroth with laughter and bright colors? I\'d create a place where humans and orcs could understand each other, no matter their language, where everyone would have so much fun that there\'d be no time to harbor old hatreds.$B$BAltruism, my friend. And hey, if I make some money along the way, who could blame me?', 0, 0, 1, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL),
(9997148, 'My knack for opportunities, inherited from my mother. My father was in his nineties when they got married, no less!$B$BYou see... This island is a natural paradise, but more importantly, the archipelago is destined to become a key nexus for global trade. The neighboring city of Azzar doubles its population every few years, and the goblin Cartels are kind enough to provide us with water and electricity. The most attractive asset, however, is the citizens of Azzar and the myriad visitors flocking to its ports eager to spend.$B$BBefore long, Kezan will look like a knockoff compared to the shining metropolis of Azzar. This faire is just the cherry on top.', 'My knack for opportunities, inherited from my mother. My father was in his nineties when they got married, no less!$B$BYou see... This island is a natural paradise, but more importantly, the archipelago is destined to become a key nexus for global trade. The neighboring city of Azzar doubles its population every few years, and the goblin Cartels are kind enough to provide us with water and electricity. The most attractive asset, however, is the citizens of Azzar and the myriad visitors flocking to its ports eager to spend.$B$BBefore long, Kezan will look like a knockoff compared to the shining metropolis of Azzar. This faire is just the cherry on top.', 0, 0, 1, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL),
(9997149, 'Hm... <Gizmo strokes his pointy chin.>$B$BThe island is much larger than the faire itself. I imagine the lush forest trees replaced by pointy tent roofs, vines swapped for cables, and neon lights instead of fireflies. Asphalt and stone where there was only grass and mud. If it were up to me, not even the mountain would be spared; it\'s so tall... Imagine a slide up there that went all the way down to the sea!$B$BAlthough we always need new investors, one must be very realistic in their projections. And very picky about who they partner with.', 'Hm... <Gizmo strokes his pointy chin.>$B$BThe island is much larger than the faire itself. I imagine the lush forest trees replaced by pointy tent roofs, vines swapped for cables, and neon lights instead of fireflies. Asphalt and stone where there was only grass and mud. If it were up to me, not even the mountain would be spared; it\'s so tall... Imagine a slide up there that went all the way down to the sea!$B$BAlthough we always need new investors, one must be very realistic in their projections. And very picky about who they partner with.', 0, 0, 1, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL),
