(9997154, '<Greely snatches the pin from your hands and puts it on their jacket.>$B$BThank you. The relationship with Gizmo has been purely symbiotic. The Noggenfogger family is delighted to invest and supply such a unique place as the Azzar Faire with our products. It was a real joy to discover that the native mushrooms of the island were the perfect raw material to develop new... recreational substances. And the Faire is undoubtedly the perfect showcase to market them.$B$B<Greely taps the pin with a cunning smile.>$B$BThis pin is a symbol of the success of a well-done business.', '<Greely snatches the pin from your hands and puts it on their jacket.>$B$BThank you. The relationship with Gizmo has been purely symbiotic. The Noggenfogger family is delighted to invest and supply such a unique place as the Azzar Faire with our products. It was a real joy to discover that the native mushrooms of the island were the perfect raw material to develop new... recreational substances. And the Faire is undoubtedly the perfect showcase to market them.$B$B<Greely taps the pin with a cunning smile.>$B$BThis pin is a symbol of the success of a well-done business.', 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL),
(9997155, 'A pin?$B$B<Aldara accepts it begrudgingly.>$B$BA pin to torment me, for my liquor is a refined elixir, a symbol of tradition and excellence completely out of place in this bustling faire. It\'s distressing to see how consumers trivialize and treat my product like a common drink, consuming it without even understanding the liquid jewel they hold in their glasses.$B$B<Aldara looks at the pin and then at you with a mix of frustration and resignation.>$B$BI, however, cannot deny the profits of it.', 'A pin?$B$B<Aldara accepts it begrudgingly.>$B$BA pin to torment me, for my liquor is a refined elixir, a symbol of tradition and excellence completely out of place in this bustling faire. It\'s distressing to see how consumers trivialize and treat my product like a common drink, consuming it without even understanding the liquid jewel they hold in their glasses.$B$B<Aldara looks at the pin and then at you with a mix of frustration and resignation.>$B$BI, however, cannot deny the profits of it.', 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL),
(9997156, 'Oh, but Gizmo is so silly! A pin as thanks? It wasn\'t necessary!$B$B<The goblin accepts the small metal badge with a fake smile. Instead of wearing it, she throws it into the bottom of her dress pocket.>$B$BAnything else? No? Splendid! If I had to wear a pin for every company I\'ve funded... I\'d run out of neckline. And that would really ruin the faire! Ask Aldara, Greely, or Hobart. The bank I preside over has a stake in all their businesses.', 'Oh, but Gizmo is so silly! A pin as thanks? It wasn\'t necessary!$B$B<The goblin accepts the small metal badge with a fake smile. Instead of wearing it, she throws it into the bottom of her dress pocket.>$B$BAnything else? No? Splendid! If I had to wear a pin for every company I\'ve funded... I\'d run out of neckline. And that would really ruin the faire! Ask Aldara, Greely, or Hobart. The bank I preside over has a stake in all their businesses.', 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL),
(9997157, 'Leisure, as you know, is essential for goblin society. Our capital aims to become the greatest power in the northern regions of the world, and to achieve such an ambitious goal, it is necessary to back splendid cultural initiatives like this faire.$B$B<Hobart takes a proud look at the pin.>$B$BNice pin, by the way. I\'ll wear it with pleasure.', 'Leisure, as you know, is essential for goblin society. Our capital aims to become the greatest power in the northern regions of the world, and to achieve such an ambitious goal, it is necessary to back splendid cultural initiatives like this faire.$B$B<Hobart takes a proud look at the pin.>$B$BNice pin, by the way. I\'ll wear it with pleasure.', 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL),
(9997158, '<Nix flips the Lucky Box over in his hands and grins.>$B$BGizmo and his promotions... Fine, fine! The first one is on the house, just like he promised. Here, your tickets back.$B$BNow go on, open it. May luck smile on you... and on the house!', '<Nix flips the Lucky Box over in his hands and grins.>$B$BGizmo and his promotions... Fine, fine! The first one is on the house, just like he promised. Here, your tickets back.$B$BNow go on, open it. May luck smile on you... and on the house!', 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL),
